# A bf16x2 pack and an integer-to-float conversion change the value's
# bits, and a cvt.u32.u64 of %tid.x + 2^32 (64 threads, from .reqntid)
# leaves 32 bits: all three stores' addresses are unknown, each with
# its reason.
RUN: %ptxroof analyze %fixtures/micro/cvt_reads.ptx | FileCheck --check-prefix=ANN "%s"
ANN: {{^}}	st.global.u32 	[%rd3], %r1; // global store addr ? (`cvt.rn.bf16x2.f32` is not an integer conversion){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	st.global.u32 	[%rd5], %r1; // global store addr ? (`cvt.rn.f32.u32` is not an integer conversion){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	st.global.u32 	[%rd9], %r1; // global store addr ? (`cvt.u32.u64` leaves 32 bits){{$}}
